			"notes": "Release, Fabric 26.3. Requires Xaero's World Map.\n\n- Settings screen: the world map stays visible behind it (like Xaero's own screens).\n- The eye button reacts to hover like Xaero's buttons, with a tooltip showing the assigned key.\n- The settings key (H by default) now opens and closes the settings from the map; Escape returns to the map.\n- Player heads are drawn under Xaero's buttons, hover frames and tooltips.\n\nAlso on [Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/xaero-head-tracker) and [CurseForge](https://www.curseforge.com/projects/1597062). Source: branch `v2/fabric/26.3`."
